    "title": "Fort Yuma Quechan Fashion Show happening next month - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Dillon Fuhrman ,\n9 hours ago YUMA, Ariz. (KYMA) - The Fort Yuma Quechan Fashion Show is happening next month, and the Yuma community is invited to attend.\nThe fashion show, happening Saturday, June 20, 2026, at the Paradise Event Center, located at 450 Quechan Drive in Yuma, at noon.\nDuring the event, there will be food and drink vendors, raffles, designer showcases, live music and entertainment and more.\nThe fashion show will go until 5 p.m. For a complete schedule of events, see attached image below.\nCourtesy: Fort Yuma Quechan Tribe\nThe post Fort Yuma Quechan Fashion Show happening next month appeared first on KYMA .",
    "summary": "9 hours ago YUMA, Ariz. (KYMA) - The Fort Yuma Quechan Fashion Show is happening next month, and the Yuma community is invited to attend. The fashion show, happening Saturday, June 20, 2026, at the Paradise Event Center, located at 450 Quechan Drive in Yuma, at noon. During the event, there will be food and drink vendors, raffles, designer showcases, live music and entertainment and more. The fashion show will go until 5 p.m. For a complete schedule of events, see attached image below.",
